---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service — Lead Answered"
  description="Lead Answered terms of service, including SMS/text messaging terms."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="section-h text-[32px] md:text-[40px] text-ink-900 mb-1.5">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[14px] text-ink-400 mb-8">Last updated: June 24, 2026</p>

    <div
      class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-semibold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-headings:text-ink-900 prose-a:text-brand-600 prose-a:font-medium prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-strong:text-ink-900 prose-li:my-1"
    >
      <p>
        These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your use of the Lead Answered
        service, operated by <strong>Grovebox LLC</strong> (“Lead Answered,”
        “we,” “us”). By using the service, or by sending or receiving text
        messages through it, you agree to these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>1. The Service</h2>
      <p>
        Lead Answered responds to inquiries you submit to businesses
        (“Contractors”) that use our service. Acting as the Contractor’s
        assistant, we text you to understand your request, answer basic
        questions, and help schedule an appointment. We do not perform the
        Contractor’s underlying services ourselves.
      </p>

      <h2>2. SMS / Text Messaging Terms</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          By providing your mobile number on a Contractor’s form, you consent to
          receive text messages from us about your request.
        </li>
        <li>Message frequency varies.</li>
        <li>Message and data rates may apply.</li>
        <li>
          Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to cancel and stop receiving
          messages.
        </li>
        <li>
          Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or email
          <a href="mailto:levi@leadanswered.com">levi@leadanswered.com</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Message delivery depends on your mobile carrier, and we cannot guarantee
          that every message will be delivered.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Terms for Contractors (Business Customers)</h2>
      <p>
        This Section 3 applies to <strong>Contractors</strong> — the businesses
        that subscribe to Lead Answered to respond to their inbound leads. It
        exists so that all text messaging on the service stays lawful and
        compliant. If you are a Contractor, you additionally agree that:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Consent is your responsibility.</strong> You must obtain, and keep
          a record of, valid prior express consent from each individual before that
          person’s phone number is submitted to the service. You will only submit
          leads from people who personally requested contact from your business
          through your own form or channel.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No cold, purchased, scraped, or rented contacts.</strong> You will
          not submit phone numbers obtained from purchased or rented lead lists,
          scraped sources, or any third party that did not directly request contact
          from your business.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Honor opt-outs.</strong> You will not resubmit a number after the
          individual has opted out (for example, replied STOP), and you will not
          attempt to circumvent opt-out handling.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Legal compliance.</strong> You are responsible for complying with
          all laws and rules that apply to your messaging, including the Telephone
          Consumer Protection Act (TCPA), applicable state telemarketing and
          “mini-TCPA” laws, and mobile-carrier and industry requirements (including
          CTIA guidelines and A2P 10DLC / toll-free registration rules).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Accurate registration information.</strong> Any business
          information you provide for carrier registration and number verification
          (legal name, address, EIN/BRN, website, use-case description, sample
          messages, and opt-in details) must be accurate and kept current.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Indemnification.</strong> You agree to indemnify and hold harmless
          Grovebox LLC from any claims, fines, penalties, or damages arising out of
          the leads you submit, your consent practices, or your failure to comply
          with this Section 3 or applicable law.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We provide the messaging infrastructure on a registered, opt-out-enabled
        basis, and we may suspend or terminate the service, or decline to message
        particular leads, if we reasonably believe messaging would be
        non-compliant. We do not provide legal advice; you remain responsible for
        your own compliance.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>
        You agree not to use the service unlawfully, to harass others, or to
        submit false or misleading information. You are responsible for the
        accuracy of the information you provide.
      </p>

      <h2>5. No Quotes or Professional Advice</h2>
      <p>
        Text messages are for scheduling and general information only. Any pricing
        is estimated on-site by the Contractor; nothing in a text message is a
        binding quote or professional advice.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>
        The service is provided “as is” and “as available,” without warranties of
        any kind, whether express or implied, including warranties of
        merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, Grovebox LLC will not be liable
        for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising
        out of or related to your use of the service.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms from time to time. Your continued use of the
        service after changes take effect means you accept the updated Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Lead Answered (a service of Grovebox LLC)<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:levi@leadanswered.com">levi@leadanswered.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
